{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30119","headline":"赋得听松声 · 刘得仁","name":"赋得听松声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭际微风动，高松韵自生。\n听时无物乱，尽日觉神清。\n强与幽泉竝，翻嫌细雨幷。\n拂空增鹤唳，过牖合琴声。\n况复当秋暮，偏宜在月明。\n不知深涧底，萧瑟有谁听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}